  <StringTable>
    <Label>HISTORY_LEADER_Option_Ilythiir_0</Label>
    <String>Pursues the preservation of ancient lore, breathing life into forgotten scripts.</String>
  </StringTable>
  <StringTable>
    <Label>HISTORY_LEADER_Option_Ilythiir_1</Label>
    <String>Developed space phobia from a childhood spent in cramped asteroid colonies.</String>
  </StringTable>
  <StringTable>
    <Label>HISTORY_LEADER_Option_Ilythiir_2</Label>
    <String>Dropped out of neural surgery program. Now avoids neural interface discussions.</String>
  </StringTable>
  <StringTable>
    <Label>HISTORY_LEADER_Option_Ilythiir_3</Label>
    <String>Imbued with ancient wisdom after years with off-world monastic isolates.</String>
  </StringTable>
  <StringTable>
    <Label>HISTORY_LEADER_Option_Ilythiir_4</Label>
    <String>Ex space sailor, accustomed to the solitude of the vast interstellar oceans.</String>
  </StringTable>
  <StringTable>
    <Label>HISTORY_LEADER_Option_Ilythiir_5</Label>
    <String>Astute space envoy, entrenched in the nuances of intergalactic diplomacy.</String>
  </StringTable>
  <StringTable>
    <Label>HISTORY_LEADER_Option_Ilythiir_6</Label>
    <String>Bares the marks of a youthful mishap with a malfunctioning food replicator.</String>
  </StringTable>
  <StringTable>
    <Label>HISTORY_LEADER_Option_Ilythiir_7</Label>
    <String>Adopts the appearance of a late clone sibling, preserving their visage against time.</String>
  </StringTable>
  <StringTable>
    <Label>HISTORY_LEADER_Option_Ilythiir_8</Label>
    <String>Ever-flipping a piece of enigmatic extraterrestrial currency, claiming it decides fate.</String>
  </StringTable>
  <StringTable>
    <Label>HISTORY_LEADER_Option_Ilythiir_9</Label>
    <String>Possesses an unwaveringly dry wit, often mistaken for a malfunctioning translation unit.</String>
  </StringTable>
  <StringTable>
    <Label>HISTORY_LEADER_Option_Ilythiir_10</Label>
    <String>Heeds twin AIs whispering strategies, providence housed in their neural implants.</String>
  </StringTable>
  <StringTable>
    <Label>HISTORY_LEADER_Option_Ilythiir_11</Label>
    <String>Archivist supreme, skilled in curating data relics from obliterated networks.</String>
  </StringTable>
  <StringTable>
    <Label>HISTORY_LEADER_Option_Ilythiir_12</Label>
    <String>Plagued by enigmatic warnings from an anonymous source, possibly an ancient AI.</String>
  </StringTable>
  <StringTable>
    <Label>HISTORY_LEADER_Option_Ilythiir_13</Label>
    <String>Experiences a clash of senses when interfacing with alien communication channels.</String>
  </StringTable>
  <StringTable>
    <Label>HISTORY_LEADER_Option_Ilythiir_14</Label>
    <String>Dreads mirrors after an encounter with a sentient and malevolent reflective anomaly.</String>
  </StringTable>
  <StringTable>
    <Label>HISTORY_LEADER_Option_Ilythiir_15</Label>
    <String>Clad in tradition, adheres to personal codes of conduct from a long-lost civilization.</String>
  </StringTable>
  <StringTable>
    <Label>HISTORY_LEADER_Option_Ilythiir_16</Label>
    <String>Compels genetic lineage investigations, hunts through DNA for traces of historic
      greatness.</String>
  </StringTable>
  <StringTable>
    <Label>HISTORY_LEADER_Option_Ilythiir_17</Label>
    <String>Grown amidst ancient servers, perceived the classics as cosmic signals guiding destiny.</String>
  </StringTable>
  <StringTable>
    <Label>HISTORY_LEADER_Option_Ilythiir_18</Label>
    <String>Believes they can communicate with plants, runs an underground botanist club.</String>
  </StringTable>
  <StringTable>
    <Label>HISTORY_LEADER_Option_Ilythiir_19</Label>
    <String>Survived a teleportation experiment gone wrong, now slightly out of phase with reality.</String>
  </StringTable>
  <StringTable>
    <Label>HISTORY_LEADER_Option_Ilythiir_20</Label>
    <String>Former weather drone operator turned poet, captures storms in verse.</String>
  </StringTable>
  <StringTable>
    <Label>HISTORY_LEADER_Option_Ilythiir_21</Label>
    <String>Has survived a hostile encounter with Irradiated lifeforms.</String>
  </StringTable>
  <StringTable>
    <Label>HISTORY_LEADER_Option_Ilythiir_22</Label>
    <String>Wrote a series of popular romance novels under a poorly maintained pseudonym.</String>
  </StringTable>
  <StringTable>
    <Label>HISTORY_LEADER_Option_Ilythiir_23</Label>
    <String>Too patient for their own good.</String>
  </StringTable>
  <StringTable>
    <Label>HISTORY_LEADER_Option_Ilythiir_24</Label>
    <String>Is easily annoyed.</String>
  </StringTable>
  <StringTable>
    <Label>HISTORY_LEADER_Option_Ilythiir_25</Label>
    <String>Maintains strong connections to their childhood friends.</String>
  </StringTable>
  <StringTable>
    <Label>HISTORY_LEADER_Option_Ilythiir_26</Label>
    <String>Discovered a minor improvement to a common engineering practice that has been widely
      adopted.</String>
  </StringTable>
